# label: alg:ch70-reserve
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch70.tex:57
# caption: Assign registers in the restricted scalar and two-unit aggregate profile.

REQUIRE classified arguments; six integer and eight SSE slots
ENSURE all-or-stack assignment for each supported aggregate
initialize used-slot counters, including any hidden result pointer
FORALL arguments in declaration order DO
  IF memory-class or either register class lacks capacity THEN
    assign the whole argument to the stack argument area
  ELSE
    reserve all required integer and SSE slots together
    assign the argument's units to those slots
  END IF
END FOR

